  m_Text: 'Pinch (hands) or hold trigger (controllers) and move along the vessel
    to push, roll your wrist to twist. Left = catheter, right = wire.

    Sticks:
    push / twist.  A/B: wire / catheter tip.  X: model.  Y: centerlines.  Stick click:
    reset.'
